# vtium's own 8x8 glyphs for the four characters of IBM code page 437 that
# Unscii-8 lacks: U+2219 BULLET OPERATOR, U+2302 HOUSE, U+2310 REVERSED NOT
# SIGN and U+263C WHITE SUN WITH RAYS. vtium-font's build adds them to the
# glyphs of unscii-8.hex when it cuts the built-in font's 8x8 strike. They
# are drawn for vtium in the style of Unscii-8's own glyphs, with strokes
# two pixels wide, and stand on row 7 of 8 as Unscii-8's do.
#
# Each line is one glyph in Unifont's hex form: a code point, a colon, and
# 16 hex digits, one byte for each row from the top, the leftmost pixel in
# the highest bit. A line that starts with '#' is a comment.
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 Aaron Bockelie <aaron@bockelie.com>
# Released under the MIT License, as vtium's LICENSE file gives it.
2219:0000001818000000
2302:00183C6666667E00
2310:007E606000000000
263C:185A3CE7E73C5A18
